// 严格字段与重名护栏只负责字节结构；真实参与链、到达/会战/本人命令由早领域源门逐项复核。
#include "resident/checkpoint/checkpoint_decode_lifecycle.hpp"
#include "military_siege_lifecycle_codec.hpp"
#include "military_officer_codec.hpp"
#include "resident/storage/common_checkpoint.hpp"
#include <algorithm>
#include <set>
namespace hanmo::resident::military_siege_lifecycle_codec {
namespace {
using V=BoundaryValue;using A=V::Array;using D=V::Dict;
Status emit_ids(ProjectionWriter& w,const StableId& name,const std::vector<StableId>& rows){return w.sequence(name,rows,[](auto& c,const auto& id){return c.field("",id);});}
Status emit_snapshot(ProjectionWriter& w,const MilitarySiegeParticipationSnapshot& s){w.field("phase",s.phase);w.field("started_tick",s.started_tick);w.field("last_tick",s.last_tick);w.field("round",s.round);w.object("armies",[&](auto& c){for(const auto& row:s.armies)c.field(row.first,row.second);return c.status();});w.object("unit_nodes",[&](auto& c){for(const auto& row:s.unit_nodes)c.field(row.first,row.second);return c.status();});emit_ids(w,"withdrawn_army_ids",s.withdrawn_army_ids);w.order_fields(s.field_order);return w.status();}
void snapshot(const V& v,MilitarySiegeParticipationSnapshot& s){const StableId p="siege_lifecycle/snapshot";boundary::fields(v,{"phase","started_tick","last_tick","round","armies","unit_nodes","withdrawn_army_ids"},{},p);s.field_order=boundary::order(v);s.phase=boundary::get_string(v,"phase",p);s.started_tick=boundary::get_int(v,"started_tick",p);s.last_tick=boundary::get_int(v,"last_tick",p);s.round=boundary::get_int(v,"round",p);for(const auto& row:boundary::object(boundary::field(v,"armies",p),p))s.armies.emplace_back(row.first,boundary::integer(row.second,p));for(const auto& row:boundary::object(boundary::field(v,"unit_nodes",p),p))s.unit_nodes.emplace_back(row.first,boundary::string(row.second,p));s.withdrawn_army_ids=boundary::strings(boundary::field(v,"withdrawn_army_ids",p),p);}
Status walk(CodecVisitor& c,MilitarySiegeParticipationSnapshot& s){c.field("phase",s.phase);c.field("started_tick",s.started_tick);c.field("last_tick",s.last_tick);c.field("round",s.round);c.sequence("armies",s.armies,[](auto& v,auto& row){v.field("id",row.first);v.field("side",row.second);return v.status();});c.sequence("unit_nodes",s.unit_nodes,[](auto& v,auto& row){v.field("unit_id",row.first);v.field("node_id",row.second);return v.status();});common_checkpoint::strings(c,"withdrawn_army_ids",s.withdrawn_army_ids);common_checkpoint::strings(c,"field_order",s.field_order);return c.status();}
Status emit_strategy(ProjectionWriter& w,const SiegeStrategicCommand& s){w.field("kind",s.kind);w.field("army_id",s.army_id);w.field("terms",s.terms);emit_ids(w,"unexpected_fields",s.unexpected_fields);emit_ids(w,"field_order",s.field_order);return w.status();}
void strategy(const V& v,SiegeStrategicCommand& s){const StableId p="siege_lifecycle/strategy";boundary::fields(v,{"kind","army_id","terms","unexpected_fields","field_order"},{},p);s.kind=boundary::get_string(v,"kind",p);s.army_id=boundary::get_string(v,"army_id",p);s.terms=boundary::get_string(v,"terms",p);s.unexpected_fields=boundary::strings(boundary::field(v,"unexpected_fields",p),p);s.field_order=boundary::strings(boundary::field(v,"field_order",p),p);}
Status walk(CodecVisitor& c,SiegeStrategicCommand& s){c.field("kind",s.kind);c.field("army_id",s.army_id);c.field("terms",s.terms);common_checkpoint::strings(c,"unexpected_fields",s.unexpected_fields);common_checkpoint::strings(c,"field_order",s.field_order);return c.status();}
Status emit_fact_body(ProjectionWriter& w,const MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact& f){w.field("id",f.id);w.field("siege_id",f.siege_id);w.field("topology_id",f.topology_id);w.field("actor_id",f.actor_id);w.field("cause_id",f.cause_id);w.field("previous_fact_id",f.previous_fact_id);w.field("kind",military_siege_lifecycle_kind_name(f.kind));w.field("tick",f.tick);if(f.before)w.object("before",[&](auto& c){return emit_snapshot(c,*f.before);});else w.null("before");w.object("after",[&](auto& c){return emit_snapshot(c,f.after);});if(f.strategic_command)w.object("strategic_command",[&](auto& c){return emit_strategy(c,*f.strategic_command);});else w.null("strategic_command");if(f.termination_reason)w.field("termination_reason",*f.termination_reason);else w.null("termination_reason");w.order_fields(f.field_order);return w.status();}
void fact(const V& v,MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact& f){const StableId p="siege_lifecycle/fact";boundary::fields(v,{"id","siege_id","topology_id","actor_id","cause_id","previous_fact_id","kind","tick","before","after","strategic_command","termination_reason"},{},p);f.field_order=boundary::order(v);f.id=boundary::get_string(v,"id",p);f.siege_id=boundary::get_string(v,"siege_id",p);f.topology_id=boundary::get_string(v,"topology_id",p);f.actor_id=boundary::get_string(v,"actor_id",p);f.cause_id=boundary::get_string(v,"cause_id",p);f.previous_fact_id=boundary::get_string(v,"previous_fact_id",p);f.tick=boundary::get_int(v,"tick",p);const auto name=boundary::get_string(v,"kind",p);bool known=false;for(int i=0;i<=8;++i){auto kind=static_cast<MilitarySiegeLifecycleKind>(i);if(military_siege_lifecycle_kind_name(kind)==name){f.kind=kind;known=true;break;}}if(!known)boundary::fail("MilitarySiegeLifecycleKindMismatch",p);const auto& before=boundary::field(v,"before",p);if(!before.as<std::monostate>()){f.before.emplace();snapshot(before,*f.before);}snapshot(boundary::field(v,"after",p),f.after);const auto& command=boundary::field(v,"strategic_command",p);if(!command.as<std::monostate>()){f.strategic_command.emplace();strategy(command,*f.strategic_command);}const auto& reason=boundary::field(v,"termination_reason",p);if(!reason.as<std::monostate>())f.termination_reason=boundary::string(reason,p);}
Status walk(CodecVisitor& c,MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact& f){c.field("id",f.id);c.field("siege_id",f.siege_id);c.field("topology_id",f.topology_id);c.field("actor_id",f.actor_id);c.field("cause_id",f.cause_id);c.field("previous_fact_id",f.previous_fact_id);Integer kind=static_cast<int>(f.kind);c.field("kind",kind);if(kind<0||kind>8)return c.reject("MilitarySiegeLifecycleKindMismatch");f.kind=static_cast<MilitarySiegeLifecycleKind>(kind);c.field("tick",f.tick);c.optional("before",f.before,[](auto& v,auto& s){return walk(v,s);});c.object("after",[&](auto& v){return walk(v,f.after);});c.optional("strategic_command",f.strategic_command,[](auto& v,auto& s){return walk(v,s);});c.optional("termination_reason",f.termination_reason,[](auto& v,auto& s){return v.field("value",s);});common_checkpoint::strings(c,"field_order",f.field_order);return c.status();}
// 目录尚未借入codec：先拒重名/非法身份/枚举；节点与每个操作的严格形状仍交具名目录验证。
Status wire_shape(const MilitarySiegeLifecycleState& s){auto fields=s.field_order;std::sort(fields.begin(),fields.end());if(!fields.empty()&&fields!=FieldOrder{"facts"})return common_failure("MilitarySiegeLifecycleShape");std::set<StableId> ids;for(const auto& f:s.facts)if(f.id.empty()||f.siege_id.empty()||f.topology_id.empty()||f.tick<0||!ids.insert(f.id).second||military_siege_lifecycle_kind_name(f.kind).empty())return common_failure("MilitarySiegeLifecycleShape",f.id);return common_success();}
}
Status emit_fields(ProjectionWriter& w,const MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact& value){MilitarySiegeLifecycleState state;state.facts.push_back(value);auto check=wire_shape(state);if(!check.ok)return check;return emit_fact_body(w,value);}
BoundaryValue encode_fact(const MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact& value){BoundaryValue out;BoundaryProjectionWriter sink(out);auto check=sink.object("",[&](auto& c){return emit_fields(c,value);});if(check.ok)check=sink.finish();if(!check.ok)boundary::fail(check.error.original.code,check.error.original.path);return out;}
Outcome<MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact> decode_fact(const BoundaryValue& value){auto state=decode(BoundaryValue{BoundaryValue::Dict{{"facts",BoundaryValue{BoundaryValue::Array{value}}}}});return state.ok?Outcome<MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact>{true,std::move(state.value.facts.front()),{}}:Outcome<MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact>{false,{},state.error};}
Status emit_fields(ProjectionWriter& w,const MilitarySiegeLifecycleState& state){auto check=wire_shape(state);if(!check.ok)return check;w.sequence("facts",state.facts,[](auto& c,const auto& f){return c.object("",[&](auto& row){return emit_fact_body(row,f);});});w.order_fields(state.field_order);return w.status();}
BoundaryValue encode(const MilitarySiegeLifecycleState& value){BoundaryValue out;BoundaryProjectionWriter sink(out);auto check=sink.object("",[&](auto& c){return emit_fields(c,value);});if(check.ok)check=sink.finish();if(!check.ok)boundary::fail(check.error.original.code,check.error.original.path);return out;}
Outcome<MilitarySiegeLifecycleState> decode(const BoundaryValue& v){try{auto check=military_officer_codec::validate_json_unique_keys(v);if(!check.ok)return {false,{},check.error};boundary::fields(v,{"facts"},{},"siege_lifecycle");MilitarySiegeLifecycleState s;s.field_order=boundary::order(v);for(const auto& row:boundary::array(boundary::field(v,"facts","siege_lifecycle"),"facts")){MilitarySiegeLifecycleFact f;fact(row,f);s.facts.push_back(std::move(f));}check=wire_shape(s);return check.ok?Outcome<MilitarySiegeLifecycleState>{true,std::move(s),{}}:Outcome<MilitarySiegeLifecycleState>{false,{},check.error};}catch(const boundary::DecodeFailure& e){return {false,{},e.error};}}
Status visit(CodecVisitor& c,MilitarySiegeLifecycleState& s){if(c.military_codec_version!=17)return c.reject("MilitarySiegeEngineeringCodecRequired");c.sequence("facts",s.facts,[](auto& v,auto& row){return walk(v,row);});common_checkpoint::strings(c,"field_order",s.field_order);if(!c.status().ok)return c.status();auto check=wire_shape(s);return check.ok?c.status():c.reject(check.error.original.code,check.error.original.path);}
}
